# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored.

# --- Web3Forms (contact form email delivery) ---
# Free access key, no signup: https://web3forms.com — enter the destination inbox
# and the key is emailed to you instantly. Safe to expose client-side: it only
# permits *submitting* to the inbox bound to the key. Use a separate key per site.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
